    "sections": {
        "description": "The Interior Store theme is a beautifully crafted, fully responsive design created specifically for interior design stores, furniture shops, home decor boutiques, luxury furniture outlets, lifestyle stores, modern furniture showrooms, home styling studios, and online decor stores. Whether you’re running a designer furniture shop, a home decor marketplace, or a trendy interior styling boutique, this theme offers the perfect platform to showcase products with elegance and style. With its clean layout and modern design elements, it supports a wide variety of interior decor items including designer furniture, luxury sofas, lighting fixtures, home accessories, decorative vases, wall art, rugs, curtains, kitchen decor, and soft furnishings. This theme is ideal for creating a visually rich shopping experience that attracts customers looking for elegant home style, luxury home decor, and stylish room design ideas. From bedroom essentials to living room furniture, office furnishings, and dining collections, you can display your catalog using intuitive product grids and beautiful image galleries. Built with SEO-optimized code and fast loading speed, the theme helps improve visibility and overall performance. Eye-catching banners, interactive sliders, and customizable homepage sections allow flexible content presentation. Integrated with WooCommerce, it delivers smooth e-commerce functionality to manage product listings, shopping carts, payments, and promotions. The theme also supports decor blog sections, testimonials, CTA buttons, product filter options, wishlist functionality, and image zoom features with plugins like YITH WooCommerce Wishlist and WooCommerce Product Filter, making it a complete solution to convert visitors into loyal customers. https://www.vwthemes.net/interior-store-pro/"
    },
